        "content": "## Data Tables Retention Cleanup\nRuns daily at 03:00 (workflow timezone **Europe/Madrid**) and deletes rows older than the retention period from the n8n Data Tables listed in `Config`.\n\nSafety: dry-run flag, per-table delete cap, run lock, per-table results in `maintenance_log`, Slack only on problems.\nTables of workflows 1-2 are intentionally NOT listed.",
